# Project: Code Mapping

Purpose:
  Map source code artifacts to semantic identifiers through mirror files.
  Source code annotations are forbidden — mirror files are the only
  mapping mechanism.

MirrorFileFormat:
  Own:      <what this artifact owns>
  Do:       <what this artifact does>
  Use:      <what this artifact uses>
  Test:     <test paths>
  ->        <pointer to module/domain model>

MirrorFileLocation:
  .sdd/project/<source-path>/<artifact>.sdd

BidirectionalResolution:
  source -> semantic: mirror file path -> semantic ID
  semantic -> source: semantic ID -> mirror file path -> real source

Rules:
  [PC1] Mirror files are created only when real source exists.
  [PC2] Mirror files MUST NOT be created for hypothetical future code.
  [PC3] Mirror file content MUST match the actual source code behavior.
  [PC4] AI MUST use mirror files for source mapping, not filesystem search.

Navigation:
  Schema: @schema.sdd
  Dependencies: @dependencies.sdd

State: +
